# Soft Size Budgets (cite)

Size SoT: `docs/architecture/quality-gate-threshold-baseline.md` § Complexity and Size.
Behavior: `docs/behavior/ai-scale-docs-conventions.md`.
Review bands: `.cursor/skills/code-quality-review/SKILL.md`.

## Confirmed numbers (do not invent conflicts)

| Artifact | Soft / review | Hard / exception SoT |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Function length | ≤ **80** lines (baseline default) | > **120** unless decomposition plan approved |
| File length | ≤ **500** lines (baseline default) | > **800** unless split plan approved |
| Java `@Service` / Vue SFC | Review warn > **400** LOC (skill soft) | Skill critical bands; baseline file hard still applies |
| Java controller / Vue composable | Soft review bands in skill table | See `.cursor/skills/code-quality-review/STANDARDS.md` + SKILL bands |
| `*Support` helpers | Prefer ≤ **200** LOC; else peel/extract (skill soft) | Must stay stateless helpers |

## Agent behavior

- Soft budgets are **guidance** for agents and `code-quality-reviewer`, not a license to
  ignore baseline hard thresholds.
- When soft targets are exceeded on manually maintained files, **prefer a separate peel
  leaf** over silent continued growth.
- Generated artifacts (e.g. `openapi-v1.ts`): size flags only on **manual** edits.
